target_objective_wID = "tutorialOptionalUnderstandPremise"
text_box_size = Vector2(400, 0)
info = "Welcome, Captain!

In [i]Stellar Cartographer[/i], you will gather exploration data (value) and sell it to space stations for nanites so that you can repair and upgrade your starship. A primary method of gaining exploration data is by discovering bodies. 

This comprehensive tutorial will teach you how to move, discover, interact, traverse wormholes, use space stations and will establish the story continued in the campaign."

