info = "At any time, press $SC_PAUSE to pause the game and view the OBJECTIVES LIST in the top right-hand corner of the screen. The OBJECTIVES LIST will provide you with more detailed information regarding your current objective(s). Some objectives are [b]NOT[/b] shown via info popups (like this)."

